 record runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. In 2025 that same pair ran 31% of normal on the middle, and January to February 2026 followed at 42%. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 19640 got 46% of normal that year.</p>"}
